# React UI components (library)

This package is a **reusable UI library**, not an app. Consumers (Archsphere, satellites) own theme CSS and domain logic.

## Structure

- Group by control: `src/dataGrid/`, `src/pagination/`, `src/icons/`.
- Export public API from `src/index.ts` only.
- Pure helpers live next to the control (e.g. `sortRows.ts`, `listPagination.ts`) — easy to unit test without React.

## API design

- **Presentational**: no Supabase, no fetch, no domain types from Archsphere.
- Receive **data** (`rows`) and **callbacks** (`onEdit`, `onDelete`, `onRowActivate`).
- All user-visible strings via **label props** (i18n stays in the host app).
- Support **`hostClassNames` / `classNames`** so hosts can map to their BEM tokens (e.g. `wbs-home__*`).
- Mark interactive modules with `"use client"` when they use hooks (Next.js App Router consumers).

## Accessibility

- Prefer semantic roles (`table`/`list`, buttons with `aria-label`).
- Sortable headers are real `<button>`s with clear labels.
- Keyboard: Enter/Space on activatable rows when `onRowActivate` is set.
- Stop propagation on action cells so row activate does not fire with edit/delete.

## Do not

- Ship opinionated purple/dark “AI default” skins as the only look — stay host-themeable.
- Put ConfirmDialog / toast / routing inside the lib unless extracted as a generic primitive by request.
- Add peer dependencies beyond React unless explicitly approved.
